Z||000000||jch82||10-21-2001||11:52 AM||||Here are a few pics from our Saturday at Joe's house in Mason, MI!! James, Ken, Stan, Travis and myself were all there!<P>This is James' slave cylinder all rigged up. We had to modify it so it would go into gear.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/IM000019().jpg">  <P>James' on the hood of my fiero! <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/IM000020().JPG">  <P><BR>Us standing around Joe's fiero.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/IM000050().jpg"> <P><BR>Josh   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jch82flag.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by jch82 (edited 10-21-2001).]||||reg||7
Z||000001||FieroMontreal||10-21-2001||12:25 PM||||Looks like you guys had lot's of Fun!||||reg||1
Z||000002||SLYGUY||10-21-2001||02:13 PM||||Looks like a great time was had. <BR>Just two questions tho...<P>Where are the fences around the properties/bars on the windows?<P>Are those leaves actually changing color?<P><BR>Sly<P>P.S. Forgive my curiousity, I live in Southern California  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ViewImage.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||jch82||10-21-2001||07:42 PM||||Yeah we had a fun time!! This was the first really nice Saturday we have had in a while! It has been really rainy and cold.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Yes, those leaves are actually changing colors. That means that snow is coming.... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Only some areas have fences around the properties. It's not a requirement or anything if that's what you were getting at...(I hope that helps)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jch82flag.jpg"> ||||reg||14
