Z||000005||rmorgandotcom||10-22-2001||12:02 AM||||The leaves change color here (what leaves there are) but it doesn't mean snow (I don't think it snowed once last year).<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rmorgansig.jpg">   <BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE> <BR><LI><I><FONT COLOR="blue">project - finale body on a 86 4 cylinder 5 speed</FONT></I><BR><LI><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/rmorgandotcom/" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/rmorgandotcom/</A><BR></UL>||||reg||1
Z||000006||Black86SE||10-22-2001||12:09 AM||||It definatly snowed here last year. We got about 24"-30" in one night. I work at a hardware store and there was not one thing that even resembled a shovel left in the store. People even bought a shovel that takes shingles off roofs for snow. My truck barely made it down the roads with 4 wheel drive. And I was greedy and bought our last snowblower  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.<P>------------------<BR>1986 V6 SE<BR>Black<BR>17" Wheels<BR>P235/45/ZR17 <BR>BF Goodrich g-Force KDWS||||reg||1
Z||000007||Tigger||10-22-2001||12:36 AM||||Looks like it was a good time!||||reg||7
Z||000008||FieroJoe||10-22-2001||10:12 AM||||Yes, besides the attack of the ladybugs, it was great.  I'm still trying to figure out what the heck Im holding in my hand and looking at, maybe its a decklid vent...<P>Just the night before, I had spent 6 hours putting the interior of my car back together, after installing some more hidden switches, 2 1/16" gauges for the a pillar, and my cd changer behind the seat.<P>Josh - did you get any pics of my switch panel?<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
Z||000009||jch82||10-22-2001||11:35 AM||||Sure did Joe. Actually Ken got a few when he went trigger happy with my camera.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/IM000049().jpg"> <P>Joe is a mastermind when it comes to electrical stuff! It's good to know that there is someone right around the corner that is an electrical expert.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jch82flag.jpg"> ||||reg||12
